; Number words spelled. Each card, and after it the record of the numbers deck that ask asked for (ten cards: a
; word's letters, -10, then 0s), in. Cards pass through except 700 + k: for those the record is word k's, and the
; letters and -10 go on, then 2 (all capitals, as in an all-capitals text); the 0s are dropped. For any other card
; the record is passed over.
;
; Address Contents Label Opcode Operand Comment
  03            rec     INP   x        03-09: a card: pass it on, or a word to spell
  04                    CLA   x
  05                    SUB   c700
  06                    TAC   pass
  07                    STO   x
  08                    CLA   n9
  09                    STO   i
  10            gf      INP   y        10-38: the record's cards
  11                    CLA   y
  12                    TAC   end
  13                    SUB   00
  14                    TAC   nx
  15                    OUT   y
  16                    JMP   nx
  17            end     OUT   y
  18                    OUT   n2
  19            nx      CLA   i
  20                    SUB   00
  21                    STO   i
  22                    TAC   rec
  23                    JMP   gf
  24            pass    OUT   x
  25                    CLA   n9
  26                    STO   i
  27            sk      INP   y
  28                    CLA   i
  29                    SUB   00
  30                    STO   i
  31                    TAC   rec
  32                    JMP   sk
  33            x       DATA  0
  34            y       DATA  0
  35            i       DATA  0
  36            c700    DATA  700
  37            n9      DATA  9
  38            n2      DATA  2
